{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>46歲名模熊黛林與郭可頌迎來結婚10周年，兩人近日北上自駕遊慶祝卻意外引發婚姻震撼彈。兩夫妻在車廂內甜蜜討論一 …</p><p></p>\n<p>46歲名模熊黛林與郭可頌迎來結婚10周年，兩人近日北上自駕遊慶祝卻意外引發婚姻震撼彈。兩夫妻在車廂內甜蜜討論一對雙胞胎女兒未來升學安排時，竟因男方一個承諾令女方當場嚇呆。這場原本浪漫的周年旅行瞬間演變成夫妻二人面臨「分居」危機的嚴峻考驗。</p>\n<h2>熊黛林與郭可頌車廂內討論女兒升學問題</h2>\n<p>郭可頌為了𠱁愛妻開心，特意精心策劃這場北上自駕遊之旅，出發時更貼心準備大袋零食及飲品。男方一邊親自駕駛一邊高唱經典情歌《分分鐘需要你》，氣氛原本相當溫馨。不過兩人在飯後繼續車程時談起兩名女兒將來出外讀書安排，熊黛林主動向丈夫提議由男方親自前往當地照顧女兒，自己則選擇留在原地。</p>\n<h2>郭可頌答應提議令熊黛林驚覺面臨分居危機</h2>\n<p>面對太太提出分隔兩地照顧女兒的要求，郭可頌當下一口答應並指自己毫不介意，更表示夫妻屆時可以不時互相探望。熊黛林聽後隨即睜大雙眼並驚訝反問自己是否不用前往，隨後直指這種久不久見一面的生活狀態等同「分居」。眼見太太陷入負面情緒，郭可頌馬上反問為何想法如此負面，隨即出手緊緊握住女方雙手給予安全感，並霸氣向女方承諾只要拖住手就不會分開，同時邀請女方陪他一同前往，成功化解這場誤會。</p>\n<h2>熊黛林婚後誕下雙胞胎女兒曾短暫淡出幕前</h2>\n<p>現年46歲熊黛林於2016年與郭可頌正式步入婚姻殿堂，婚後順利誕下一對雙胞胎女兒，一家四口生活一直保持和睦。她在婚後初期曾經短暫減少公開露面，專心擔任全職家庭主婦照顧兩名千金。直到近年她開始積極重返幕前工作，不但頻繁接拍各大內地綜藝節目，更頻頻現身直播間進行帶貨工作，努力兼顧事業與家庭發展。</p>\n<h2>網民大讚郭可頌舉動貼心成功保護十年婚姻</h2>\n<p>相關影片曝光後迅速在網絡上引發廣泛討論，不少網民對於這對夫妻結婚10年依然保持甜蜜互動表示羨慕。有網民留言大讚男方處理危機的手法十分成熟，直指「郭可頌真係好顧家又寵妻」、「一個動作就畀到十足安全感」。同時亦有人認為兩人為女兒升學未雨綢繆展現出負責任態度，評論寫道「做父母真係唔容易，連結婚周年都要牽掛住仔女升學」。\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1793611266802987_12356912916ae8560320599.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"vPO1T0_mivS6S5i90iJfk778-4MdSpB7Dmj-dw5o_nc.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1793611266802987_12356912916ae8560320599.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：小紅書）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179361126968825547_7635838076ae85605ddfeb.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-11-02 下午5.17.17.png/1904x1974_q90.png\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179361126968825547_7635838076ae85605ddfeb.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：小紅書）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179361128165497472_7152514656ae856120acb8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"DbkdHqcBivlr42CpN9kRJ9WkTpsnDcZfSwM6wEsDOsA.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179361128165497472_7152514656ae856120acb8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：小紅書）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179361128361413873_17166197296ae85613ca208.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"eIWpYjK08QdYJWoQg5O9daSX8211XVmPTn-8l05_vJc.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179361128361413873_17166197296ae85613ca208.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：小紅書）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/lynnx1010_1760066127_3740028206922752800_652653955_167591256368eccf88dd910-1024x1362.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"熊黛林 郭可頌 （圖片來源：IG@lynnx1010）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/lynnx1010_1760066127_3740028206922752800_652653955_167591256368eccf88dd910-1024x1362.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@lynnx1010）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/lynnx1010_1760066127_3740028207216337841_652653955_211449598068eccf868b8ea-1024x1365.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"熊黛林 郭可頌 （圖片來源：IG@lynnx1010）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/lynnx1010_1760066127_3740028207216337841_652653955_211449598068eccf868b8ea-1024x1365.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@lynnx1010）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/zafqz8tj4x0mno2h7vcowcadht6deuugjdqdvow0hvy_69906014368c90bd4100d9.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"熊黛林 自爆 （圖片來源：熊黛林抖音）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/zafqz8tj4x0mno2h7vcowcadht6deuugjdqdvow0hvy_69906014368c90bd4100d9.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：熊黛林抖音）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%88%86%e5%b1%85%e5%8d%b1%e6%a9%9f/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">分居危機</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%86%8a%e9%bb%9b%e6%9e%97/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">熊黛林</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%83%ad%e5%8f%af%e9%a0%8c/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">郭可頌</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3534540\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 2 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T11:41:09.717557+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1296,"images":7,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T09:21:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T12:38:57.671495+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T11:38:37.452732+00:00","content_hash":"7754eb6bce4692a947fa0735e81e27ea2b99473220a1646ce76611ea9feeb02e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}